UID:83855388e7113b4a2a8290b7168b4645@russewines.com
DESCRIPTION:-------------------------------- Join us at our tasting room a
 t 5 pm to get settled with your team over some wine\, and then trivia star
 ts promptly at 5:30 pm. There will be three rounds\, ten questions in each
  round. Teams of up to six people. A prize will be awarded to the winning 
 team! Hosted by our owner & winemaker\, Kevin Bersofsky. Trivia will span 
 a range of trivia categories but always some music involved \;) Free entry
 . Offering wines by the glass and bottle\, and a few light bites available
  for purchase. You are welcome to bring in take out from any of our neighb
 oring restaurants. #supportlocal We really appreciate RSVPs so we get an i
 dea of head count. Please RSVP by emailing your name and number in your gr
 oup to info@russewines.com OR text us at 707-473-8241 Join us at our tasti
 ng 
LOCATION:Montagne Russe Winery\, 155 Petaluma Blvd N\, Petaluma\, CA 94952
URL:https://www.russewines.com/events/Vino---Vinyls-Trivia-Night---May-20
