DESCRIPTION:-------------------------- Uncork your summer of love & let th
 e good wines roll with an afternoon exploring the eight wine destinations 
 of downtown Petaluma. Welcome to the first ever Petaluma Summer Wine Stro
 ll - a follow up to last December's highly successful Winter Wine Stroll.
  Explore the eight wine tasting rooms and wine bars along the one mile sp
 an of downtown Petaluma. Each location will be pouring 2-3 of their most p
 opular wines. We have also added in two downtown restaurants\, Della Fatto
 ria and Hank's\, to provide you with some satiation along your journey. Th
 is stroll is Woodstock themed! - We encourage 60's and 70's inspired outfi
 ts or flair of any sort. All attendees will be divided up among the eight 
 wine businesses for their check-in point. You will begin at one of the ass
 ign
LOCATION:Montagne Russe Winery\, 155 Petaluma Blvd N\, Petaluma\, CA 94952
